flowchart TB
  subgraph interfaces[独立前端与网关]
    Console[管理中台 · Console]
    Futures[期货研究工作台 · Futures]
  end
  subgraph catalog[资源与治理]
    Registry[Registry · 版本与加密凭证]
    Hub[ToolHub · Skill / MCP 注册、检查、验活]
    RegistryDB[(资源与凭证库)]
    HubDB[(ToolHub 数据域)]
    Registry --> RegistryDB
    Hub --> HubDB
  end
  subgraph execution[执行数据域 · 两个独立部署单位]
    Runtime[Runtime · 授权、回执、取消、恢复]
    Worker[Worker 多实例 · 固定 DSH 核心]
    ExecutionDB[(运行 / 调用 / 检查点 / Agent 持久化笔记)]
    Runtime --> ExecutionDB
    Worker --> ExecutionDB
  end
  subgraph evidence[资料与产物]
    Knowledge[Knowledge · 上传与绑定检索]
    Indexer[Indexer · 持久化索引队列]
    KnowledgeDB[(知识资料与分块)]
    Storage[Storage · 哈希产物与引用]
    ArtifactDB[(产物库)]
    Sources[Sources · 许可域名公开资料采集]
    SourceDB[(原始响应与来源)]
    Knowledge --> KnowledgeDB
    Indexer --> KnowledgeDB
    Storage --> ArtifactDB
    Sources --> SourceDB
  end
  subgraph operations[隔离与观测]
    Sandbox[Sandbox · 授权与限时容器]
    SandboxDB[(沙箱作业)]
    Telemetry[Telemetry · 落盘接收与导出]
    TelemetryDB[(Inbox / 导出状态)]
    Sandbox --> SandboxDB
    Telemetry --> TelemetryDB
  end
  Console --> Registry & Hub & Runtime & Knowledge & Storage & Sources
  Futures --> Registry & Runtime
  Worker --> Registry & Hub & Storage
  Hub -->|调用转交，保留回执事务| Runtime
  Runtime -->|HTTP| Registry & Hub & Knowledge & Storage & Sandbox
  Runtime -->|已绑定 MCP| Sources
  Knowledge & Sandbox -->|HTTP 权威授权| Runtime
  Telemetry -->|HTTP 领取 / 确认事件| Runtime
  Telemetry --> Langfuse[Langfuse · 至少一次观测]
  Worker --> Model[外部模型 API]
  Indexer --> RAG[可选 Milvus / LightRAG / Embedding]
  Knowledge --> RAG
